# Engineering Gates — Definition of Done

Follow the canonical standard: **`.ai/standards/orchestration.md`**
(Proportional Definition of Done). Do not invent extra artifacts.

**Artifacts are earned by complexity, risk, or uncertainty.**

Classify once (S/M/L/XL + signals) via `rorcc workflow new-feature --plan --request "…"`,
then honor `.ai/workflows/new-feature.yaml` `applies_when`. Empty classification
keeps the path router only.

## Never skip

- Security when auth/secrets/authz apply
- Validation at trust boundaries
- Error handling that prevents data loss
- Tests for non-trivial logic (`.ai/standards/testing.md`)
- Migration review when migrations exist
- Test-stack bootstrap on a **new** Rails app (`.ai/standards/project-bootstrap.md`)

## Skip on size S with no risk signals

Feature Spec · User Stories · ADR · Technical Design · module docs · full QA.

Work stays on `feature/<ticket>-<slug>` (never `main`).
